{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近いい香りのものを\n集めるのが好きヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に好きなのは柔軟剤の香り♪\n洗濯物にモフって顔をうずめる時が\nすごく幸せ〜(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柔軟剤をいろんなの試してたら\n今家に5種類くらい集まっちゃった☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんが幸せ〜♪って\n感じるのはどんなとき？♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のMステ SUPER LIVE 2014\n観てくれましたか〜ヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうだったか云々の前に謝罪を..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"階段を降りて登場する時に\n足を滑らせて転んでしまいました/ _ ;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出る直前にみんなで\n転ばないようにしようね！とか\n礼儀正しくお辞儀して\n出て行こうね！とかって\n言ってた矢先の出来事だったので\nもう申し訳なくて仕方が\nなかったです(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋に戻って泣いていたら\n玲奈さんが慰めに来てくれました/ _ ;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/27/8325721/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて☆個人的にそんなスタートを\n切ってしまったMステですが\n豪華すぎるほどのアーティストの\nみなさんが集結していました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中に乃木坂が\n出させてもらえて嬉しいです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は何度目の青空か？を\n披露させてもらったんだけど\n衣装は天使のようなイメージの\n真っ白なワンピースヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/27/8325721/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/27/8325721/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいと鼻の下を伸ばす私"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/27/8325721/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさまい♡美し〜(〃ﾉωﾉ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーがみんな可愛すぎて\nずっと、可愛い〜♡やば〜い♡\nって言ってた気がする。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪飾りはカチューシャは\n事情があってダメなので王冠♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"指原さんに、\nなんで真夏ちゃんだけ\n王冠つけてるの？！って\n言われました(OωO )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてマネージャーさんには\n私が髪飾りをつけているだけで\n爆笑されました（笑）なぜだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さらにそれを見ていた未央奈も\nニタニタ笑っていましたヾ(-ω-*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/27/8325721/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年も出させてもらえるように\nみんなで頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が出させてもらってる\n20±SWEETが発売中です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インタビューもグラビアも\n盛りだくさんの■ページ(´°ω°｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょこっとだけオフショットを♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/27/8325721/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/27/8325721/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私には珍しいポニーテール♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見たら感想聞かせてくださーい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/27/8325721/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみの表紙が目印っ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/27/8325721/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メェ〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて明日は京都で\n今年最後の握手会(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう年末なんだね、本当に早い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年末ということで一つの区切りとして\n握手で感謝の気持ちをしっかり\n伝えたいです\\( ^^)/♡\\(^^ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば最近、\n超能力研究部の3人の中で\n私が言ってるちょっぴり暴言ちっくな\n言葉やNOGIBINGOのヤンキー企画で\n言ったヤンキー言葉を\nリクエストして来る方が\n増えた気がする...(OωO )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドMな方が多いんで\nしょうか？(人-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそれと同じくらいに\n私がしゃべり出すとすかさず、\nしーーーーーーっ！と\nイジリーさんのように\n話を遮る人も多い（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん面白くて私も\n一回一回楽しんじゃってます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏の握手会はそれぞれ\n楽しみたいように\n楽しんでいいところなので\nなんでもウェルカムでーす(^^)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日アレ着よーっと♪\n(コスプレじゃないよ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんに\nおこられませんように...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/27/8325721/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も早いから朝から\n来てくれる方は早く寝るんだよ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お寝坊さんには強めの\nパンチします(-ω-ﾒ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/27/8325721/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへっ♡"}],"source":"archive"}